## Storage Requirement

- At least 60 GB of free disk space is recommended.

## Software Requirement

- Docker Engine or Docker Desktop with Compose v2
- Load the architecture-specific archive as documented in `README.md`; every
  subsequent evaluation command is architecture-independent.
- If Docker denies access to `/var/run/docker.sock`, prefix Docker and Docker
  Compose commands with `sudo` as shown in `README.md`.

## Time Requirement

- The smoke tests for certified synthesis have 3 programs (each has spec generation workflow, velvet workflow and lean workflow). If one wants to run all variants, then you'd need to run 9 workflows. Each run takes roughly 30 minutes.
- The specification PBT smoke tests also should run in less than an hour.
